        "jsCode": "// Update workflow static data with last successful run time\nconst project = $json.project;\nconst timestamp = $json.timestamp;\n\n// Update static data\nconst staticData = $workflow.staticData || {};\nif (!staticData.lastRuns) {\n  staticData.lastRuns = {};\n}\nstaticData.lastRuns[project] = timestamp;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    project: project,\n    state_updated: true,\n    timestamp: timestamp,\n    output: $json.output\n  }\n}];"
      },
